WEBVTT

00:00:16.970 --> 00:00:20.890
Altair: A Record of Battles

00:01:43.520 --> 00:01:46.310
I've wanted to see you, eagle boy.

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:48.940
Rod Orm.

00:01:49.230 --> 00:01:51.860
Dance of the Moonlit Beauty

00:01:52.110 --> 00:01:53.360
Rod Orm?

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:56.200
A much rumored military group
from the Empire.

00:01:56.360 --> 00:01:58.700
Oh, and what are they doing in Muzrak?

00:01:58.860 --> 00:02:01.200
The four stratocracies are opposing Birlik Torqye.

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.370
This must mean Minister Louis
has been behind it all, doesn't it?

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:06.750
How astute.

00:02:08.370 --> 00:02:11.750
I'll make sure you won't be able to flap
that smart mouth of yours again.

00:02:11.920 --> 00:02:15.420
We have somewhere to be.
If you mean to interfere...

00:02:15.590 --> 00:02:16.720
we will show no mercy!

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:18.010
Oh, how wonderful.

00:02:18.590 --> 00:02:22.640
That means we can fight to the death,
no holds barred.

00:02:26.480 --> 00:02:29.520
I, Abiriga, shall cover your weak point.

00:02:29.730 --> 00:02:30.730
Weak point?!

00:02:30.980 --> 00:02:32.980
Padrone, you are free to do as you wish.

00:02:33.190 --> 00:02:34.820
Thank you!

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:49.710
You little--

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:06.560
This is twice now.

00:03:06.850 --> 00:03:11.060
Wait! I won't ever get in your way again.
So please!

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:14.520
If Minister Louis has turned his sights on Torqye,

00:03:14.690 --> 00:03:17.530
then I will rip off his limbs
when the time comes.

00:03:17.780 --> 00:03:21.490
When the time comes?
You think that will be good enough?

00:03:22.410 --> 00:03:24.490
You've lost the initiative to Minister Louis.

00:03:24.660 --> 00:03:26.870
There's nothing you can do now!

00:03:27.410 --> 00:03:31.670
The Torqye Pashalu is finished already.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.380
What is that?

00:03:38.420 --> 00:03:40.300
It's the Muzrak cavalry!

00:03:42.550 --> 00:03:44.600
You stupid and kind boy.

00:03:44.800 --> 00:03:48.060
You will live to regret not killing me
when you had the chance.

00:03:51.310 --> 00:03:54.440
-Kiros! Abiriga!
-Padrone!

00:03:54.650 --> 00:03:57.440
Damn it, they've really overdone it.
Hide in here.

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:03.280
We're trapped.

00:04:03.490 --> 00:04:04.530
Over here!

00:04:05.070 --> 00:04:07.870
Yo, you guys all look well.

00:04:10.330 --> 00:04:12.870
Take my hand, brother.

00:04:18.800 --> 00:04:20.170
What happened to the cavalry?

00:04:20.420 --> 00:04:22.880
Beyolu Beyazit is acting as our decoy.

00:04:23.090 --> 00:04:24.970
Prenses Aishe, you are okay.

00:04:25.140 --> 00:04:26.140
Of course.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:30.430
Obviously we did not barricade ourselves in
without making the necessary preparations.

00:04:31.310 --> 00:04:34.650
I met Sultan Balaban.

00:04:36.560 --> 00:04:40.230
We received reports that Beyolu Beyazit
and Prenses Aishe

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:43.280
were spotted among the forces
who interfered with our pursuit.

00:04:44.990 --> 00:04:49.740
I am convinced now. While he remains sultan,
Birlik Torqye will collapse.

00:04:49.910 --> 00:04:52.500
It seems it was not so roundabout after all.

00:04:53.870 --> 00:04:57.500
Muzrak, Balta, Buchak, Kuluch...

00:04:57.840 --> 00:05:01.260
The Divan has decided to dismiss the
four sultans of these stratocracies.

00:05:02.460 --> 00:05:03.760
Mahmut Bey.

00:05:04.170 --> 00:05:06.180
I will give you your orders from the Divan.

00:05:06.340 --> 00:05:10.060
You are to aid the anti-Sultan factions
within the four stratocracies,

00:05:10.220 --> 00:05:12.100
and lead a rebellion.

00:05:13.680 --> 00:05:15.600
Commanding a rebellion?

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:17.940
Just hold on a second, Suleyman Bey.

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:23.820
In other words, if this plan fails,
Mahmut Bey will take the blame for it, correct?

00:05:31.700 --> 00:05:33.120
Beyolu Beyazit.

00:05:33.330 --> 00:05:35.750
Do you not have any objections?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:41.750
My brother Balaban is the type of man who
will not give up his ambitions as long as he lives.

00:05:42.590 --> 00:05:47.260
This is the only way Birlik Torqye
can become whole again.

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:50.930
There has always only been one path.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:06:00.060
Virgilio Louis, the fire you've started
has indeed spread.

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:02.230
Terrifyingly so.

00:06:03.030 --> 00:06:05.110
But that all ends here.

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:10.780
I, Tughril Mahmut, humbly accept the Divan's command.

00:06:11.530 --> 00:06:14.790
Please lend me your knowledge and strength.

00:06:15.120 --> 00:06:17.790
Well said, Mahmut.

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:22.590
Please wait, Zaganos Pasha!

00:06:23.250 --> 00:06:27.590
I beg you to reconsider!
Stoking rebellion within Birlik Torqye?

00:06:27.800 --> 00:06:31.100
Why don't I go persuade the four sultans?

00:06:31.260 --> 00:06:33.850
It has already been ten days since
the Divan's decision.

00:06:34.010 --> 00:06:37.230
You have yet to move past this?

00:06:37.390 --> 00:06:40.100
There is much we must do.

00:06:41.770 --> 00:06:43.770
Please wait, we aren't finished.

00:06:44.230 --> 00:06:48.280
I'm sorry, but I do not have the time
to stop thinking as you have.

00:06:48.900 --> 00:06:50.280
Zaganos Pasha!

00:06:59.460 --> 00:07:01.170
Our plan for rebellion

00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:05.960
will be complete once all sultans are replaced
with Pro-Torqye leaders.

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:10.590
We could've had Balaban's head
if we got the order a little sooner.

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:12.720
Yes, I wasted a real opportunity.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:18.180
I will have you two take over the sultanates
for Muzrak and Balta.

00:07:20.600 --> 00:07:23.810
-That leaves Buchak and Kuluch...
-Yo, boss.

00:07:24.020 --> 00:07:25.820
It's coming into view.

00:07:26.150 --> 00:07:29.240
That's the Buchak Sultanlu's capital, Mujher.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:34.200
-Apparently it's treason.
-So that's what the pasha looks like.

00:07:34.370 --> 00:07:36.700
They all look evil.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:48.510
This is a problem.

00:07:48.670 --> 00:07:50.510
We can't enter the city like this.

00:07:50.720 --> 00:07:52.720
I'm surprised how good they are.

00:07:52.890 --> 00:07:56.510
That is the work of my brother's court painter.

00:07:56.680 --> 00:08:00.180
It's a masterpiece that would normally
cost more than 50 serifs.

00:08:01.390 --> 00:08:03.650
Doesn't seem like there's one for me.

00:08:03.900 --> 00:08:07.860
Mahmut, I think we might be able to get by
if it's just the two of us.

00:08:10.820 --> 00:08:12.820
Reason for entering the country?

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.070
It's our honeymoon.

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:19.700
My wife just insisted on seeing the city's
finest gems.

00:08:19.870 --> 00:08:22.870
Let's find the perfect one for you, my love.

00:08:23.750 --> 00:08:25.130
Thanks a bunch.

00:08:27.710 --> 00:08:32.470
The gems polished here in Mujher are sent
to be processed in Torqye's capital Altu,

00:08:32.630 --> 00:08:37.390
where they are made into the renowned jewelry,
Torqyery, fetching about ten times the original price.

00:08:37.600 --> 00:08:38.680
Ten times?

00:08:38.890 --> 00:08:44.100
Well, if Birlik Torqye disbands,
that'll be the end of that business.

00:08:44.270 --> 00:08:46.900
Did you meet with the kulak
stationed in this city?

00:08:47.110 --> 00:08:51.030
Yeah, do you mind checking out
the western border with me?

00:08:54.780 --> 00:08:56.660
From Suleyman to Zaganos Pasha

00:08:56.870 --> 00:08:59.160
I have met up with Mahmut Bey,

00:08:59.330 --> 00:09:03.870
and a secret agreement between the Empire
and the four stratocracies has definitely been made.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:14.090
Look.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:19.100
It's a new roadway that connects directly
from the Empire.

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:24.600
Once it's completed, Buchak will be able
to secure a position as a trade hub,

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.850
and instead of selling rocks for three serifs,

00:09:28.020 --> 00:09:32.070
they'll be able to sell jewelry for 30 serifs.

00:09:32.440 --> 00:09:37.660
If it's that lucrative, then I can understand how it'd
be more appealing to join forces with the Empire.

00:09:37.860 --> 00:09:41.490
Buchak was bought with wealth
while Muzrak was bought with prestige.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:45.830
Once the road is completed,
trafficking gems won't be the end of it.

00:09:46.040 --> 00:09:47.580
When the road is completed,

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:52.630
there could be motions for a trade agreement
between the Empire and the four stratocracies...

00:09:52.800 --> 00:09:55.130
It's a nice move.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:02.180
If the coup is not staged before this road is completed,

00:10:02.350 --> 00:10:04.470
then the Torqye Pashalu is finished.

00:10:04.930 --> 00:10:09.230
Let us split up into two groups
to move forward with Buchak and Kuluch.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:12.070
Then I shall go to Kuluch.

00:10:12.480 --> 00:10:15.530
Kuluch's Sultan Selim is an old friend.

00:10:15.690 --> 00:10:17.070
But most of all,

00:10:17.280 --> 00:10:19.740
it is where my future husband the Prens resides.

00:10:21.660 --> 00:10:22.740
In that case,

00:10:22.950 --> 00:10:24.490
Beyolu Beyazit,

00:10:24.660 --> 00:10:26.120
Suleyman Bey...

00:10:26.620 --> 00:10:31.290
I would like both of you to seek out a new
pro-Torqye ruler for Buchak,

00:10:31.460 --> 00:10:34.250
and the rest of us will head to Kuluch.

00:10:34.670 --> 00:10:36.670
We must make it in time.

00:10:39.260 --> 00:10:43.180
Thank you. You didn't have to go through
the trouble of preparing this villa.

00:10:43.600 --> 00:10:46.680
Oh, it was nothing, Prenses Aishe!

00:10:46.850 --> 00:10:49.980
I even have perfume, dresses, and sheets--

00:10:50.190 --> 00:10:51.480
This is him.

00:10:52.860 --> 00:10:55.320
My fiancé and Kuluch Sultanlu's Prens Orhan.

00:10:55.480 --> 00:10:56.990
Prens of Kuluch Sultanlu
Orhan

00:10:57.150 --> 00:10:59.740
Thank you for coming to me for help!

00:11:00.320 --> 00:11:02.990
You will be safe as long as you're in this villa.

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:06.660
Any ally of Prenses Aishe is a friend of mine.

00:11:06.870 --> 00:11:09.040
-Please, have some fruit.
-Oh, thank you.

00:11:09.210 --> 00:11:12.040
Orhan, there is something I'd like to ask of you.

00:11:12.210 --> 00:11:14.420
Yes, your wish is my command!

00:11:15.050 --> 00:11:19.420
Would you allow me an audience
with your father, Sultan Selim?

00:11:21.220 --> 00:11:26.350
The masked sultan whose face has never been
seen by anyone on the Divan council.

00:11:26.810 --> 00:11:29.520
My father only does Balaban's bidding.

00:11:29.680 --> 00:11:32.350
-You'll only be captured.
-No.

00:11:32.770 --> 00:11:36.360
Sultan Selim would never do something so foolish.

00:11:43.200 --> 00:11:47.120
My father Selim is a man who hides
his true thoughts even from his own son.

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:48.870
This is just too dangerous.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:52.080
Please take me hostage if things should fall apart.

00:11:53.580 --> 00:11:57.710
Padrone, should I kill Sultan Selim
if the opportunity presents itself?

00:11:57.920 --> 00:11:58.920
No.

00:11:59.420 --> 00:12:04.300
We should try and discover the true motives
hidden behind his mask.

00:12:07.430 --> 00:12:10.060
Sultan of Kuluch Sultanlu
Selim

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:16.440
So you were one of the guests after all,
Mahmut of Torqye.

00:12:18.230 --> 00:12:21.150
And would you be Prenses Aishe?

00:12:22.820 --> 00:12:24.660
It is nice to see you again.

00:12:25.070 --> 00:12:30.160
I am surprised someone in your position
is able to stand before me.

00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:35.630
It is a truly pathetic sight,
wagging your tail for my uncle Balaban.

00:12:35.790 --> 00:12:37.960
You are nothing compared to Tughril Mahmut here

00:12:38.210 --> 00:12:41.510
who would stand up to fight
Balaban and his cronies.

00:12:42.380 --> 00:12:44.800
However, you do have my sympathies.

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:47.510
The Kuluch Sultanlu is a minor power.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:50.890
You are neither a military nation that
can produce horses like Muzrak,

00:12:51.060 --> 00:12:54.980
nor an industrial nation like Buchak
that manufactures products.

00:12:55.150 --> 00:12:59.480
You cannot refuse other nations
should they ask you to join their rebellions.

00:12:59.730 --> 00:13:02.780
Even when you know complying
will bring about your downfall.

00:13:03.990 --> 00:13:06.780
They have already cut off your escape route.

00:13:07.320 --> 00:13:08.780
Am I wrong?

00:13:08.990 --> 00:13:13.290
Prenses Aishe, I am not sure where
your misunderstandings stem from,

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:17.000
but I truly see Balaban as a sworn friend.

00:13:17.210 --> 00:13:18.920
Nations do not have friends.

00:13:19.960 --> 00:13:24.220
There are only changing interests
affected by the constant state of flux.

00:13:24.380 --> 00:13:28.470
Just as I, a man from Torqye,
have appeared before you.

00:13:35.390 --> 00:13:36.520
It's okay.

00:13:39.020 --> 00:13:44.530
The only thing the Kuluch Sultanlu has to gain
from joining the Empire is safety.

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:46.660
There could be nothing else.

00:13:46.820 --> 00:13:49.320
But now that he knows he can coordinate with Torqye...

00:13:49.660 --> 00:13:52.290
He should reconsider his position.

00:13:52.490 --> 00:13:57.290
Father! Prenses Aishe is my fiancé!
How could you sell her out to Balaban?

00:13:57.500 --> 00:13:58.790
Prenses?

00:13:59.210 --> 00:14:01.840
Throw them in the ninth tower.

00:14:02.000 --> 00:14:04.800
We will hand them over to the Muzrak Sultanlu.

00:14:06.970 --> 00:14:09.220
Good night.

00:14:11.470 --> 00:14:16.560
I was afraid for a moment
that the sultan might join sides with Torqye.

00:14:17.690 --> 00:14:19.480
Torqye and Balt-Rhein.

00:14:19.650 --> 00:14:22.360
Which is more in Kuluch's best interest?

00:14:22.570 --> 00:14:24.990
That should be plain to see.

00:14:27.070 --> 00:14:29.360
I am so sorry, prenses.

00:14:30.160 --> 00:14:33.120
We never should have trusted my father...

00:14:35.910 --> 00:14:39.120
Padrone, Selim might be on our side.

00:14:39.620 --> 00:14:42.340
The area around this cell seems hollow.

00:14:42.500 --> 00:14:45.260
It's likely there is a hidden pass--

00:14:46.970 --> 00:14:48.510
Sultan Selim?

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:50.970
I apologize for earlier.

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:54.970
Precautions are necessary as I am being
monitored by agents of the Empire.

00:14:55.720 --> 00:14:57.180
As I thought.

00:14:58.140 --> 00:15:01.980
Wearing this allows me to put on a successful act

00:15:02.150 --> 00:15:04.860
without having to fear the Imperials or the Muzrakians.

00:15:05.480 --> 00:15:10.570
Turning our back on Torqye
was an extremely bitter decision.

00:15:10.950 --> 00:15:13.070
There is no future joining the Empire's side.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.330
Those are my true feelings.

00:15:15.910 --> 00:15:19.830
I really thought that you fell in with Balaban.

00:15:21.580 --> 00:15:24.460
To think that the prens and future ruler
of Kuluch

00:15:24.630 --> 00:15:27.130
could not even see through that.

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:31.090
Even when your fiancé managed to see the truth.

00:15:32.970 --> 00:15:36.100
Mahmut Bey, I want to help you,

00:15:36.260 --> 00:15:38.850
but if I show any signs of breaking the alliance,

00:15:39.020 --> 00:15:42.730
Balaban and the others will likely destroy
Kuluch in the blink of an eye.

00:15:42.900 --> 00:15:43.900
I am sorry, but...

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:47.190
There is another way, Sultan Selim.

00:15:48.320 --> 00:15:51.570
Hold a wedding ceremony for Orhan and myself.

00:15:53.450 --> 00:15:56.950
Of course, you will have to leave my name
out until the ceremony,

00:15:57.120 --> 00:16:00.330
but if Kuluch's prens were to be married,

00:16:00.540 --> 00:16:04.000
then you will be able to openly invite
the other sultans here.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:06.880
If we can round them all up in the wedding hall,

00:16:07.050 --> 00:16:09.710
our coup will be complete.

00:16:09.880 --> 00:16:12.010
What if the sultans do not come?

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:14.180
Then we simply proceed with the wedding.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:18.850
Sultan Selim can then use the opportunity
to announce the transfer of power to his son.

00:16:19.310 --> 00:16:21.850
That will void the alliance.

00:16:22.020 --> 00:16:25.360
The sultans who did not come
would not be able to lodge any complaints.

00:16:25.690 --> 00:16:30.110
My goodness, my son truly is not worthy
of a prenses like you.

00:16:30.900 --> 00:16:35.160
Father, this is a spectacular idea!
Let us hold the wedding right away!

00:16:35.990 --> 00:16:39.370
We will begin making the preparations right away.

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.750
Please send out an urgent message
to all stratocracies.

00:16:45.960 --> 00:16:51.090
We are having a wedding ceremony
for my son Prens Orhan.

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:56.220
It's a little unbelievable
how well things have progressed.

00:16:56.510 --> 00:16:57.800
On the day of the wedding,

00:16:57.970 --> 00:17:02.730
Kuluch will not hesitate to switch sides again
if they sense it's in their best interest.

00:17:03.350 --> 00:17:05.440
That is certainly a possibility.

00:17:05.600 --> 00:17:09.230
Yes. That is actually what a ruler should do.

00:17:10.400 --> 00:17:13.530
Even if everything goes well...

00:17:14.070 --> 00:17:15.160
Prenses Aishe.

00:17:15.610 --> 00:17:17.870
Are you okay with this?

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:20.370
What do you mean?

00:17:20.790 --> 00:17:25.120
Well, do you not want to be married

00:17:25.330 --> 00:17:27.500
to someone you love?

00:17:28.130 --> 00:17:34.090
It seems the rumors of you being
a completely naive child pasha were wrong.

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.930
But it is an unnecessary concern.

00:17:37.090 --> 00:17:42.140
Political marriages are the standard
for monarchies like the four stratocracies.

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:45.190
Prenseses are trained for that purpose,

00:17:45.350 --> 00:17:48.770
and it's a respected role acknowledged
to have the power to unify nations.

00:17:48.940 --> 00:17:52.440
That is something to be proud of,
and not to be lamented.

00:17:52.980 --> 00:17:56.650
Besides, even if I were to become fond of someone,

00:17:57.160 --> 00:18:00.490
they would not necessarily reciprocate the feeling.

00:18:03.330 --> 00:18:05.330
-This way, Beyolu!
-Okay!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:08.500
-Over here!
-How did they know where we were?

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.510
So you are back, Ismail.

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:17.930
Sultan of Buchak Sultanlu
Uzun

00:18:18.090 --> 00:18:20.850
Yes, Beyolu Ismail has returned to serve you.

00:18:21.010 --> 00:18:22.560
Beyolu of Buhak Sultanlu
Ismail

00:18:22.720 --> 00:18:24.890
These are treasures from around Rumeriana.

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:27.230
Please accept these offerings.

00:18:28.350 --> 00:18:32.860
Of my 45 sons, I had especially high expectations of you.

00:18:33.020 --> 00:18:34.280
Continue the good work.

00:18:34.440 --> 00:18:35.900
You honor me with your words.

00:18:36.320 --> 00:18:41.120
By the way, Father, I have heard sordid characters
have been running rampant.

00:18:42.030 --> 00:18:45.540
If it should please you,
I shall capture these outlaws.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.660
-You will?
-Yes.

00:18:47.830 --> 00:18:51.080
With the influence, information,
and wealth of our Djinn Company,

00:18:51.250 --> 00:18:53.670
as well as my own power,

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:56.630
I believe I can capture them before your men can.

00:18:56.840 --> 00:19:00.130
Oh, that is reassuring.

00:19:01.850 --> 00:19:04.140
Apologies for the rough treatment.

00:19:04.560 --> 00:19:08.390
I very much wanted to speak with you
before my father could.

00:19:08.770 --> 00:19:11.650
What exactly is going on here, Mr. Ismail?

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:14.650
I thought that we could join forces.

00:19:16.150 --> 00:19:19.780
Orquesta, the mercenary group from South Rumeriana.

00:19:20.110 --> 00:19:23.530
I'm sure this many men didn't come cheap.

00:19:23.740 --> 00:19:26.290
They're worth every coin if they get results.

00:19:26.580 --> 00:19:30.830
As I'd expect from the successor of the Djinn Company,
one of the top competitors in Buchak.

00:19:31.460 --> 00:19:33.420
If you ask me...

00:19:34.000 --> 00:19:36.460
My old man fails to understand

00:19:36.630 --> 00:19:39.590
what the construction of this new roadway will mean.

00:19:39.760 --> 00:19:44.220
If the city prospers, then everyone will want a piece.

00:19:44.390 --> 00:19:48.220
Without protection, it's only a matter of time
until we're invaded.

00:19:48.390 --> 00:19:51.390
It's hard to imagine an independent Buchak
separated from Torqye,

00:19:51.560 --> 00:19:53.860
will have the power to do so.

00:19:54.190 --> 00:19:58.070
In that case, it would be better for us
to be under the protection of Birlik Torqye

00:19:58.230 --> 00:19:59.940
where we can continue doing business.

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:02.860
It does seem like we will be able to work together.

00:20:03.070 --> 00:20:07.830
Say that we cooperate, exactly how much
will you be able to contribute?

00:20:08.040 --> 00:20:13.250
We are talking about a rebellion after all.
I take it you've made the necessary arrangements?

00:20:13.420 --> 00:20:16.090
Beyolu Beyazit has 500 men loyal to him.

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:20.050
Torqye is willing to supply as many weapons,
horses, and provisions as needed.

00:20:20.380 --> 00:20:21.380
What else?

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:25.550
We have our ally, Prenses Aishe's fiancé,
in the Kuluch Sultanlu.

00:20:26.140 --> 00:20:27.600
What else?

00:20:28.470 --> 00:20:30.600
That is everything at this point.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:33.600
What? That's not going to be nearly enough.

00:20:33.810 --> 00:20:38.440
The total forces of Buchak, Muzrak, and Balta
are 23,500 men.

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:42.110
In comparison, we have his 500 men
and Kuluch's 5000 soldiers.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:45.160
Even if I hired as many Orquesta mercenaries
as I could afford,

00:20:45.320 --> 00:20:47.450
we're looking at 5600 men at best.

00:20:48.990 --> 00:20:50.580
I don't like these odds!

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.920
At this point,
it seems better to hand you over to Balaban

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.920
and have him owe me a favor.

00:20:56.130 --> 00:20:58.710
Please wait, Beyolu Ismail.

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:02.970
I would like you to come alone
with me to our tent.

00:21:03.510 --> 00:21:07.720
Then I will show you the power
that can bring down my brother Balaban.

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:12.230
-He's just trying to use you to escape!
-You must not go, Master Ismail!

00:21:12.430 --> 00:21:14.140
Interesting.

00:21:15.690 --> 00:21:18.360
You aren't lying, are you?

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.160
Please look at this.

00:21:53.600 --> 00:21:55.480
A shark yay!

00:21:57.480 --> 00:22:00.520
We have 77 in total.

00:22:04.190 --> 00:22:06.200
We have ourselves a deal.

00:23:48.550 --> 00:23:52.090
No matter how hard we try
to take the best course of action,

00:23:52.470 --> 00:23:54.930
why must we constantly take the paths
we do not wish to?

00:23:55.470 --> 00:23:57.890
Next time, "The Prince of Swords!"

00:23:58.100 --> 00:24:01.440
The sword in one's hand is a sign of one's resolve.
